[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23829.948, "timestamp": "06:37:09", "text": "線控按鈕符號。好的。明白了。  開始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23833.27, "timestamp": "06:37:13", "text": "你好。  其實，我開快車。這個屏幕是為你的眼睛準備的。  哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23854.628, "timestamp": "06:37:34", "text": "炸彈來了。我看到六個。哦，不。六根電線。  好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23858.39, "timestamp": "06:37:38", "text": "呃，有黃色嗎？有一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23860.548, "timestamp": "06:37:40", "text": "黃色的。好的。呃，而且不止"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23862.15, "timestamp": "06:37:42", "text": "一根白線。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23864.468, "timestamp": "06:37:44", "text": "不止一根"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23866.628, "timestamp": "06:37:46", "text": "白色電線。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23874.468, "timestamp": "06:37:54", "text": "呃"}]